# INVWINJC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the screens an
# item's parts go back through, at level 3.  CTRL+D on item 2, its copy's
# form closed by ENTER (OK), which keeps it, makes items 4 to 10; Install
# in then installs each item from 10 down to 2 in the one before it, a
# chain of ten levels below item 1.  From item 1's form Parts opens its
# parts, and from there ENTER on the first part, the one below, then
# Parts in its form opens that part's parts, down to item 10's, none.
# ESC goes back to item 9's parts with item 10's form over them, and ESC,
# closing the form, then ESC again go back so through the parts of items
# 8 to 2; the frame keeps the eight screens last left, so ESC on item 2's
# parts, closing item 3's form, then ESC again open the item list without
# a form, the parts of item 1 and item 1's form having been dropped.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINJC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER DOWN
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
K CTRL-D ENTER
S COPIES
K END ALT-C I
T 9
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 8
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 7
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 6
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 5
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 4
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 3
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 2
K ENTER
K UP ALT-C I
T 1
K ENTER
K HOME ENTER
